  "adviceCycleInflatedTitle": "The cycle counter flatters the pack",
  "adviceCycleInflatedBody": "The BMS claims {factor} times more cycles than the charge actually put through the pack justifies. It counts partial charges as whole ones. If you are buying or selling a pack, the honest number is the equivalent-cycle figure.",
