  "adviceHealthDecorativeTitle": "The BMS health figure never moves",
  "adviceHealthDecorativeBody": "It is still pinned at 100% with real cycles behind it. Plenty of firmwares never recompute it. Ignore it and go by measured capacity.",
  "adviceCapacityBelowTitle": "There is less capacity here than the label claims",
  "adviceCapacityBelowBody": "The numbers the BMS reports imply {percent}% less than the pack is rated for. That could be real degradation, or a coulomb counter that has drifted. A full capacity test settles it either way.",
