        "type": "String"
      }
    }
  },
  "adviceNoCapacityTestTitle": "You have never actually measured the capacity",
  "adviceNoCapacityTestBody": "It is the only way to know whether you got what the box said. Charge to full, ride until it cuts off, and let the app integrate the amp-hours that came out. Everything else is an estimate.",
  "adviceRunningHotTitle": "The pack is running hot",
  "adviceRunningHotBody": "It reached {temp} °C. Ease off and check nothing is blocking airflow. Heat is what ages a lithium cell fastest.",
